        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.10\n    coupon_payment = face_value * annual_coupon_rate\n\n    spot_rate_1 = 0.08\n    spot_rate_2 = 0.09\n    spot_rate_3 = 0.095\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    bond_price = (\n        coupon_payment / (1 + spot_rate_1)\n        + coupon_payment / (1 + spot_rate_2) ** 2\n        + (coupon_payment + face_value) / (1 + spot_rate_3) ** 3\n    )\n\n    answer = round(bond_price, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
